    <h1>INGOs have raised {{ peer_benchmarks.total }} impact funds. What peers teach you about raising yours.</h1>
    <p class="detail-sub">
      Patterns from {{ peer_benchmarks.total }} INGO-sponsored peer funds — for teams considering or actively raising their first impact fund.
    </p>
  </header>

